Operating Principles & Security Model
* Presence‑based access: Member must be on facility Wi‑Fi. If not, the app shows: “you are not on the facility’s Wi‑Fi.”
* Device‑specific login: Member credentials are bound to a single device; sharing locks out the original device. Easy device replacement flow.
* No Bluetooth, no kiosks, no fobs: Minimal hardware footprint; requires existing electric strike and the Kinect ReliaGate controller.
* Staff password resets: Reset links are valid for 5 minutes due to elevated privileges.
* Plan‑to‑Access linkage: If a plan has no access schedule attached, the member will not see the lock/unlock button in the app.
## Access Workflows
Remote Unlock (one‑off)
Path: Dashboard → Facilities → View → Remote Unlock (confirm).
Effect: Immediate entry; event logged.
Temporary Access Pass (short‑term; not a plan)
Path: Temporary Passes → Create Temporary Pass.
* Add recipient email; set start/end window (default ~1 hour).
* Recipient verifies by email, accepts waiver, and must be on gym Wi‑Fi during the window.
* After end time, pass auto‑expires; attendance visible under Temporary Passes.
