Policies & Common Procedures (Highlights)
* Staff Password Reset: Links expire in 5 minutes. Standard reset link: https://dashboard.facilitykinetics.ca/dashboard/forgotpw
* Find Payments (no Stripe login needed):
   * Finances → View Payments for recent payments (incl. failed).
   * Memberships → Search → [Member] → Payments for per‑member history.
* Change Pricing: Do not edit live plan prices. Grandfather existing members, archive the old plan, create a new plan with the new price. Update website links. Optionally move members to a new plan on the next cycle or immediately.
* Missing Unlock Button: Ensure the member’s plan has an access schedule attached.
